obligations.text:
The Secretariat shall, in particular:
—
identify and manage potential conflicts of interests;
—
monitor compliance with the rules of procedure referred to in Article 8 and compliance with the requests to carry out tasks according to Article 68(3) of Regulation (EU) 2024/1689;
—
process requests from market surveillance authorities to the scientific panel for additional expertise;
—
process requests from Member States for support by experts for the purpose of their enforcement of Regulation (EU) 2024/1689 at national level.
